.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt PA220-LEDS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pa220-leds
.Nd display or change PA-220 Ethernet jack LED modes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Oo Ar port
.Op Ar mode
.Oc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility displays the LED mode for each of the eight front Ethernet jacks
on a Palo Alto Networks PA-220.
Specify a
.Ar port
from 1 to 8 to display a single jack.
Changing a mode requires superuser privileges.
.Pp
The available modes are:
.Bl -tag -width link-activity
.It Cm link-activity
Show link on the left LED and blink the right LED on activity.
This is the default.
.It Cm link
Show link on the left LED and turn the right LED off.
.It Cm combined
Show link and blink on activity on the left LED.
Turn the right LED off.
.It Cm off
Turn off both LEDs.
.It Cm 0x Ns Ar RL
Set the right and left 88E1680 LED function codes, respectively.
Each code is a single hexadecimal digit from 0 through b.
.El
.Pp
Changes are reset at reboot.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
